      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "Yong Hui’s slimming restaurant served fresh peas, carrots, eggplants, and raw cucumbers with vinegar. As the hostess, she said fibres benefited customers' digestion the most. In order not to let Yong Hui get away with telling lies, Wang Peng spied on Yong Hui despite her glare.",
        "zh": "咏慧的减肥餐馆供应新鲜的豌豆，胡萝卜、茄子，还有加醋的生黄瓜。作为女店主，她说膳食纤维最有助于顾客消化。为了不让咏慧撒谎后逃过惩罚，王鹏不顾她的怒视，暗中调查她。",
