        "index": 4,
        "text": "Your customers put on weight too easily, while Yong Hui’s lose weight too quickly. So, Wang Peng, cut down on the fat in your food and increase vegetables and fruits, like nuts, beans, mushrooms, peaches and lemons. You ought to combine the two menus and provide a balanced diet.” Before long, Wang Peng won his customers back.",
